## OPERATING SYSTEM WITH CPU SCHEDULING

*IQ* what is the limitation of queue data structure?
        -- space limitation
        -- overcome by using circular queue

QUEUE
    -- linear data structure
    -- follows FIFO
    -- OPERATIONS
            1. Enqueue -- Insertion [REAR] ^++
            2. Dequeue -- Deletion [FRONT] ^++

    -- CONDITIONS
            -- front == rear == -1  -> empty
            -- front == rear        -> single element
            -- rear == size-1       -> full